AUDIO: 'know if it\'s going to pick up the wind noise or not, but hopefully I Okay, there\'s a couple times throughout this video where the noise cancellation actually because of the wind cut off my voice as well. So, I\'m just going to cut in a couple of times with a voice over here. But to enable deep track, you just'

[02:02] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'click on the menu button and then choose deep track. And then to pick your subject, you just hold down the C1 button and then trace over yourself or over your vehicle or whatever. And then it will lock on. Now, if you don\'t have'

